Independence and trademarks
===========================

Jev and TypeSafe are products of TypeSafe AI. Grok Bot is a product of its maker. This
project is independent and is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by TypeSafe AI,
the maker of Grok Bot, or the authors of the upstream project below. Names are used only
to describe what this project works with.

The upstream CLI is not included
================================

This repository contains no code from the upstream project. `install.sh` downloads the
upstream `jev` CLI (jevkit) from its own repository at install time, under its own licence.

Adapted skill content
=====================

The ten skills in skills/ are adaptations for Grok Bot of skill documentation in:

kerpopule/hermes-jev-skills (Hermes Jev Skills) - https://github.com/kerpopule/hermes-jev-skills
Version adapted: 0.22.1 (commit a6f6344bae3411b2afaabd640dc28cda736e8894)

What each skill here was adapted from, in upstream's skills/ folder, README.md and docs/:

  jev-setup-grok        skills/jev-setup/SKILL.md, AGENTS.md, README.md ("Your API key never
                        touches the agent", "Everything fails open")
  jev-search-loop       skills/jev-search/SKILL.md, docs/search-loop.md
  jev-social-research   skills/jev-social-research/SKILL.md
  jev-passage-filter    skills/jev-memory/SKILL.md
  jev-mailbox-sort      skills/jev-mailbox/SKILL.md
  jev-support-triage    skills/jev-mailbox/SKILL.md (the triage comparison), README.md (Triage)
  jev-routine-wake      the cron-wake decision policy description (jevkit/policies/cron-wake.json)
  jev-typed-decision    skills/jev-frontier-work/SKILL.md (claim check), skills/jev-browser-use/SKILL.md
                        (yes/no check), docs/writing-a-jev-question.md, the `jev ask --help` example
  jev-choose-turns      skills/jev-compaction/SKILL.md
  jev-watch-run         skills/jev-frontier-work/SKILL.md ("Watch the run")

The "What leaves the machine" sections summarise upstream README.md "What leaves your
machine". Example inputs and the documented output shapes were written and checked for this
project by running the upstream CLI.

